<title>GERMANY: Escada '95/96 net income up 14.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Escada '95/96 net income up 14.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to October 31, 1996:</p>
<p>(In millions of marks, unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group sales				    1,230 vs 1,170</p>
<p>    Operating profit			     31.9  vs 30.6</p>
<p>    Net profit				     32.3  vs 28.2</p>
<p>    DVFA-Earnings per share		    19.11 vs 18.65 marks</p>
<p>    Cash flow					69    vs 68</p>
<p>    Share equity				   224   vs 196</p>
<p>    Liabilities				    308   vs 278</p>
<p>    Fixed asset investments		    33    vs 22</p>
<p>    Employees					4,238 vs 4,264</p>
<p>Dividends</p>
<p>    - Common shares				six   vs six marks</p>
<p>    - Preferred				    seven vs seven marks</p>
</text>
